	"identifying_description": "Egg-yolk yellow silk mantle embroidred with stylized floral elements in polychrome silk.  The front panels of the mantle are pieced in from an earlier chrypy of slightly lighter yellow.  The embroidery is exceptionally fine, especially on the front panels.  The vestigial sleeves are still stitched to each other at the back \r\n\r\nThe lighter yellow panels on each side of the front opening are in fragile condition; cloth has cracked in places.",
